Provider operation failed: LastPass CLI (lpass) is not installed.

To install it:
  - macOS: brew install lastpass-cli
  - Linux: Check your package manager (apt install lastpass-cli, yum install lastpass-cli, etc.)
  - NixOS: nix-env -iA nixpkgs.lastpass-cli

After installation, run 'lpass login <your-email>' to authenticate.
